  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "S1",
      "text": "I'm happy with the court's decision."
    },
    {
      "id": "S2",
      "text": "Ripping up the Earth to grab its coal is outdated and not good for nature in general."
    },
    {
      "id": "S3",
      "text": "The long-term consequences cannot be positive."
    },
    {
      "id": "S4",
      "text": "There are a number of ways to harness the power of nature (wind, solar) without harming it, and I look forward to the day when that is the norm."
    },
    {
      "id": "S5",
      "text": "If it takes the courts to lead Australia into the future, so be it."
    }
  ],
